@startuml

hide footbox

participant "xxx"
note right of xxx: src/cmd/internal/dwarf， \ndwarf调试信息生成，分散在compile、link，\n这部分代码是二者共享的。

' Define participants
participant "*.go" as P0
participant "compiler" as P1
participant "plist" as P2
participant "assembler" as P3
participant "objectfile" as P4
participant "linker" as P5
participant "executable" as P6

' Compilation Phase
activate P1
P0 -> P1: 1. Write Go source code
P1 -> P1: 2. Lexical analysis (get tokens)
P1 -> P1: 3. Syntax analysis (get AST)
P1 -> P1: 4. Semantic analysis (type checking)
P1 -> P1: 5. Build SSA, SSA.compileFunctions
P1 -> P1: 6. SSA-based optimization
P1 -> P2: 7. Write pseudo instruction list
activate P2
P2 -> P1: 8. Generate *.s assembly file
deactivate P2
note left of P1: Generate DWARF info during phases 3-5
P1 -> P3: 9. Pass *.s to assembler
activate P3
deactivate P1

' Assembly Phase
P3 -> P3: 10. Assemble to machine code
activate P4
P3 -> P4: 11. Write *.o object file
P3 -> P4: 12. DumpData (gcdata, plugintable, gc embeds)
P3 -> P4: 13. DumpObj (compiler/linker object file)
deactivate P3

' Linking Phase
P4 -> P5: 14. Pass object files to linker
activate P5
deactivate P4
P5 -> P5: 15. Static linking, symbol analysis, relocation
P5 -> P5: 16. Merge DWARF info
P5 -> P5: 17. Generate additional DWARF info
activate P6
P5 -> P6: 18. Create final executable
deactivate P5

@enduml
